media: i2c: dw9768: add the Dongwoon DW9763 compatible

The Mi Max 2 rear camera focuses with a Dongwoon DW9763 voice-coil driver. It
has the same register map as the DW9768 (power, ring-mode control, 10-bit
position), so the mainline dw9768 driver drives it unchanged; it only needs to
match "dongwoon,dw9763", the compatible used in kernel/dts/.

Signed-off-by: Dimitris Vagiakakos <dimitrislinuxos@protonmail.ch>

--- a/drivers/media/i2c/dw9768.c	2026-09-29 20:45:58.036385626 +0300
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/dw9768.c	2026-09-29 20:45:58.037177537 +0300
@@ -528,6 +528,7 @@
 }
 
 static const struct of_device_id dw9768_of_table[] = {
+	{ .compatible = "dongwoon,dw9763" },
 	{ .compatible = "dongwoon,dw9768" },
 	{ .compatible = "giantec,gt9769" },
 	{}
